  "releaseNotes": "OpenMaui 11.0.10.2:\n- Screen readers got a text control's whole box for every character\n- Screen coordinates were the window's\n- Screen readers saw no window in GTK mode\n- The native window title follows MAUI's rule, as on its other platforms\n- A handler used before `UseLinux` kept MAUI's base view mappings without OpenMaui's\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
